                        "review": "A weird puzzle sandbox that can be interesting at first, but it often feels more confusing than fun. The game encourages experimentation, though the lack of clear direction makes a lot of it feel aimless rather than rewarding. There are moments of charm and chaos, but they don’t always come together into something satisfying. It’s an okay experience, but not one I’d strongly recommend unless you really like experimental indie games.",
